    <div class="container" style="max-width: 68ch;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>How your information is handled.</h1>
      <p>
        This page is a placeholder. Before launch, replace this with a real privacy notice covering what
        personal information is collected through the contact and appointment forms, how it's stored, who it's
